    "Reason : 1 - The proposed third-floor infill extension by reason of its form, siting and scale would be a dominant and incongruous addition to a building which otherwise makes a positive contribution to the character and appearance of the Hampstead Conservation Area. The proposed works (including the loss of the existing second-floor window) would cause harm to the character and appearance of the host building and the Conservation Area, contrary to policies A1, D1 and D2 of the Camden Local Plan 2017, Policies H26, H27 and H28 of the Hampstead Conservation Area Statement 2001, and Policies DH1 and DH2 of The Hampstead Neighbourhood Plan 2025.\r\n"
